Description: simple desktop calculator with a Tk interface
 Desktop calculator written in Python 3 with a Tk graphical interface.
 .
 Supports the basic arithmetic operations, power, modulo, square root,
 sine, cosine, floor and ceiling, memory keys (M+, M-, MR, MC) and input
 from the keyboard.
 .
 Простой настольный калькулятор на Python 3 с графическим интерфейсом Tk.
